     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts CdaRTO-PQ-PQToRatioConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"CdaRTO-PQ-PQToRatioConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"hcCdaRTO-PQ-PQToRatioConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping de <code>http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/StructureDefinition/RTO_PQ_PQ</code> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Ratio\">Ratioversion : 4.0.1)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>RTO_PQ_PQ.numerator</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>Ratio.numerator</td><td>Le numérateur CDA est converti en Quantity via le mapping PQ -&gt; Quantity, puis affecté à Ratio.numerator.</td></tr><tr><td>RTO_PQ_PQ.denominator</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>Ratio.denominator</td><td>Le dénominateur CDA est converti en Quantity via le mapping PQ -&gt; Quantity, puis affecté à Ratio.denominator.</td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap CdaRTO-PQ-PQToRatioConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"en-CdaRTO-PQ-PQToRatioConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcCdaRTO-PQ-PQToRatioConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping from <code>http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/StructureDefinition/RTO_PQ_PQ</code> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Ratio\">Ratioversion: 4.0.1)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr>